WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the Roon homepage promo film (39.7s, silent — the text on
screen IS the narration). Timings follow the overlay fades in the
master build (promo-src/build.sh): each line appears as its overlay
fades in and leaves as the next scene takes over.

00:00.400 --> 00:05.100
You already took the photos.

00:05.100 --> 00:09.800
Thousands of them. Sitting in the dark.

00:09.800 --> 00:15.000
Rooney goes through all of it.

00:15.000 --> 00:22.200
She finds the threads — the same garden, the same smile, years apart.

00:22.200 --> 00:27.400
And writes them into a story you don't just remember —

00:27.400 --> 00:34.100
— you relive it, together.

00:34.100 --> 00:39.700
Roon. Your family's story, told. roonapp.co
